{"articleNo":"252717","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=252717&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2021-1 폐강과목 안내 및 수강신청 정정신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.03.09","hit":"19313","attachments":[{"name":"2021-1학기_폐강대상강좌_내역(공지용).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=252717&attachNo=97120"},{"name":"폐강과목+수강정정신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=252717&attachNo=97121"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2021-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 폐강과목을 아래와 같이 공고하오니 대상과목을 수강 신청한 학생은 다른 과목으로 수강정정 기간 내에 변경하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">정정신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;2021. 3. 10.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">), 10:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">부터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;~&nbsp; 3.11.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">), 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">까지&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">승인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 3. 10. ~ 3. 12.)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">정정신청 가능 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">폐강된 과목에</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수강 신청한 학생만 정정 신청 기간 수강신청 가능</span></u></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">정정방법</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">신청할 과목에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">여석이 없을 경우</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; “</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">원스톱서비스</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">학사관리</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 변경 및 정정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">에서 수강 정정신청</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">신청 전 반드시 수강가능여부를 확인할것</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">신청할 과목에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">여석이 있을 경우</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">폐강과목 수강정정 신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">서식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">]”</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">를 작성하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">교무처로 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">gmg0416@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">본인이 신청한 과목 중 폐강 된 과목 수 만큼만 변경이 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">정정한 과목에 대해서는 수업시간에 반드시 출석부 확인을 하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2021-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 합반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">분반 및 폐강대상 강좌내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
